  "description": "DynamicPDF Viewer is a PDF viewing control you can embed in a .NET Windows Form application. Viewer is highly efficient and lightweight and can add PDF viewing to any WinForm application without relying on any third party or external resources.\n\nDynamicPDF Viewer for .NET seamlessly integrates with our other DynamicPDF products allowing applications to display PDF output from any of our other DynamicPDF tools (but will work with any PDF file regardless of producer). It is compatible with PDF version v1.1 to v1.7.\n\nDynamicPDF Viewer is backed by a great team of developers and support staff. Flexible licensing (including royalty free) is available to mee t all your needs.\n\nRelease Notes:\n\n* Resolved an issue where thumbnail icon continued to display even when ShowThumbnailIcon was set to false.\n* Fixed a problem where text could not be selected in the Viewer for certain PDF documents.\n* Fixed an issue that crashes the application when a specific PDF is opened.",
  "iconFile": "Resources/icon.png",
