  "releaseNotes": "* Resolved an issue where thumbnail icon continued to display even when ShowThumbnailIcon was set to false.\n* Fixed a problem where text could not be selected in the Viewer for certain PDF documents.\n* Fixed an issue that crashes the application when a specific PDF is opened.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": "DynamicPDF Viewer is a highly efficient and lightweight .NET PDF viewing control that allows PDF viewing capabilities to be embedded within .NET Windows Form applications.",
